   License:   Apache License 2.0
   Copyright: Qdrant (see upstream LICENSE)
   Role:      ONNX-based text embedding inference library

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (default embedding model, runtime)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Project:   https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
   License:   MIT License (BAAI / FlagEmbedding model terms)
   Role:      Default model for semantic search (`BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5`, 384-dim)
